# Scripts that run inside Linux containers must check out with LF on every
# host. Git for Windows converts to CRLF by default, and a CRLF init script
# mounted into checks-postgres killed the container, which the agent waits
# on (2026-09-28). The .bat is the one file that wants CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
